NOTICE — synthetic-ambient-fhir-25 dataset

This directory contains the "synthetic-ambient-fhir-25" dataset: 25 fully
synthetic patients (Synthea-simulated records with LLM-generated transcripts
and notes; no real patient data). It was provided by Abridge for use during
the Future of Agentic AI in Healthcare hackathon (Abridge x Anthropic x
Lightspeed, San Francisco, 2026-07-18).

This dataset is NOT covered by the repository's Apache-2.0 license. Its
redistribution terms have not been confirmed with Abridge. Until they are,
treat the dataset as provided for hackathon use only: do not redistribute it
separately from this repository, and do not rely on it under Apache-2.0.

